# Generate Schema Snapshot — Synth v2

This document explains how to generate a full database schema snapshot.

## Purpose

A schema snapshot is:
- a **reference only**
- useful for documentation, debugging, onboarding
- NOT the source of truth

Source of truth = `src/migrations/`

---

## Generate snapshot (MariaDB)

Run from terminal:

```bash
mysqldump \
  -h $DB_HOST \
  -P $DB_PORT \
  -u $DB_USER \
  -p \
  --no-data \
  --routines \
  --triggers \
  $DB_NAME \
  > docs/database/schema_snapshot.sql
